      "pointer": "/states/frackinShipSelected/text",
      "en": "The Frackin' Ship. Upgraded differently, get more space by building it yourself and improve its performance with better engines and boosters.\n\nCurrently Selected Ship: <shipName>\nCurrently Selected Ship Mode: <shipMode>",
      "tr": "Frackin' Ship farklı şekilde yükseltilir. Gemiyi kendin inşa ederek daha fazla alan kazanabilir, daha iyi motorlar ve iticilerle performansını artırabilirsin.\n\nSeçili Gemi: <shipName>\nSeçili Gemi Modu: <shipMode>",
